', RESPONSE_FORMAT_WITHOUT_COMMAND if self.config.openai_functions else RESPONSE_FORMAT_WITH_COMMAND)
    use_functions = self.config.openai_functions and self.command_registry.commands
    return f"Respond strictly with JSON{(', and also specify a command to use through a function_call' if use_functions else '')}. The JSON should be compatible with the TypeScript type `Response` from the following:
{response_format}
"

